      "userId": 8045440327,
      "displayName": "Liam Webster",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "I think this is just a cool thing God opened up for me... this guy was looking for his bus and was going to be late, and so I notice his bus beginning to leave in the distance and I sprint in front of the bus, and manage to stop its just in time so the guy could get on. No joke being a Christian makes you feel like a superhero. Thank God I get to do stuff like that.",
