      "messageId": 5485,
      "userId": 8045440327,
      "displayName": "Liam Webster",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Prayer for Toni, hes another homeless guy, so that he might get some assistance and that God may continue to bless, him... funnily enough he prayed for me first after I bought him food so hes a fellow believer in Christ. Send him lots of love, once again Jesus makes me feel like a super hero, I was able to stop a bus beforehand for a anotherguy at the last second stepping out and halting it so he could get on... wait as I am typing this he turned around and started talking will let you guys know what happens next",
